    "blurb": "Fetch and parse RSS and Atom feeds",
    "overview": "Integrate RSS/Atom feeds into Camunda-based business processes. Fetch news, blog posts, or any RSS content directly into processes with powerful filtering and processing capabilities.",
    "rating": null,
