  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Fetch and parse RSS and Atom feeds with date filtering, sorting, and structured output",
    "splashDescription": "The RSS Feed connector enables seamless integration of RSS and Atom feeds into Camunda-based business processes. Fetch news, blog posts, or any RSS content directly into your processes with powerful filtering and processing capabilities. This connector is perfect for news aggregation workflows, content monitoring automation, daily digest generation, alert systems based on feed content, and multi-source content consolidation. It processes up to 500 feed items with configurable filtering, making it suitable for both small feeds and large-scale news sources. Key features include support for RSS 2.0 and Atom feeds; date range filtering (from/to); configurable item limits (1-500); automatic sorting by publication date; rich metadata extraction (title, link, description, author, categories); built-in timeout protection and error handling; and feed metadata access (title, description, last update).",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/643614/overview/img4420586785261404764.png?be33d618b9d182c13df87fccfafeed53",
